# Normalise all text files to LF, in the repository *and* the working tree.
#
# History: many blobs here stored CRCRLF, and with core.autocrlf=true checkout
# added a third CR, producing CRCRCRLF. WordPress Plugin Check flagged 117 files
# as Internal.LineEndings.Mixed, and any tool that rewrote a whole file tripled
# its line endings. Pinning eol=lf makes the working tree deterministic.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.svg  -text
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
*.mo  binary
